LOCUS       pBR322_pas_DnaA          183 bp    DNA     linear   UNK 01-JAN-1980
DEFINITION  The pBR322 region just past the ColE1-family DNA replication start
            (pBR322 2351-2533), carrying the lagging-strand primosome assembly
            site (pas) and a DnaA box; it lies directly 3' of the ColE1 origin
            in pBR322 and pUC vectors..
ACCESSION   pBR322_pas_DnaA
VERSION     pBR322_pas_DnaA
KEYWORDS    .
